\": \"C31\",\n  \"fingerprints\": {\n    \"source\": \"9ab10b540b916aba02d03b5bdf88e19c431562ca5da086243211a936ace7a532\",\n    \"dependencies\": \"404662cdc1e76235824fc92b55fe49a7e8d2ebfd9f1ea4cb1ae7c8a2bcdf544e\",\n    \"build_flags\": \"166488b352224eb230ddfca178064d76f43deecbb6c73fb6d9359f56632e1a1f\",\n    \"evidence\": \"1121a1fd30c42999941d7597e821558f71ae6f69bbf4bfe3459c43201ffbd659\"\n  },\n  \"scores\": {\n    \"architecture\": 9,\n    \"behavior\": 9,\n    \"authority_security\": 9,\n    \"validation\": 9,\n    \"overall\": 9\n  },\n  \"required_fixes\": [],\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"evidence_gaps\": [],\n  \"optional_suggestions\": [\n    \"Retained nonrequired presentation note: apps/desktop/src/v2/admin/review-sheet.tsx displays Draft for issued and completed rotations although the rotation panel reports the correct stage. Deriving that pill from RotationView.stage would remove the inconsistency; this does not require another C31 cycle.\"\n  ],\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"This is an independent C31 verdict, including its declared shared-source remediation. The final C31 review cap and any owner-assigned standing remain separate from these actual scores. This passing verdict requires no conditional score override and does not complete C32 or P09.\",\n    \"Recomputed all four supplied fingerprints. All 7,889 scoped file hashes matched initially and at final recheck. Independently verified the membership and content of all 18,342 compiled-input entries, identical before/after build and check inventories, build flags, and all 18 check-log hashes. Hash consistency does not authenticate compiler execution or evidence authorship.\",\n    \"Verified the sealed 30-path source transition, integrated fix ancestry, current executable, complete 1,621-entry fixture bundle including modes and symlinks, and all six frozen prototype files. The recorded G9 build uses aarch64-apple-darwin and test-fixtures; signed installed-release behavior is outside this verdict.\",\n    \"The revocable presentation owner now travels from configuration review/result admission through native effect execution, queued presentation and explicit copy permission. Inspected the production Host/IPC regressions and original reload and queued-presentation red/green evidence. Current retained logs report all ten lifecycle cases passing. I did not independently reproduce AppKit scheduling races or run a fresh Rust suite.\",\n    \"Verified required evidence, preparation, executable, driver and controller bindings across all 19 current native drivers. C31-N01–N04 and C39-N01–N04 pass on the current bundle. The unrelated superseded raw C24-N06 failure remains preserved rather than relabeled.\",\n    \"Read retained AX trees and representative captures. Both Gateway key kinds now reach successful details with Edit, Rotate, Remove and Close details, without Runtime staged-rotation actions. Independently ran all 12 read-only administration coverage tests successfully. Native interaction and spoken VoiceOver output were not independently exercised here.\",\n    \"Retained current logs report 550 renderer tests, 15 ui_v2_reviews tests and the host regressions passing. Inspected production-interface tests cover typed review binding, tenant retirement, delayed settlement, unknown outcomes, reconciliation, durable rotation facts and stable timestamps; passing counts alone were not treated as behavioral proof.\",\n    \"Verified C30's exact raw verdict, request, receipt, audit and owner-decision bindings. C30 remains owner-complete with its independent 9/9/9/8/8 fail verdict and closed findings unchanged; those findings were not reopened. C29's actual full-nine G7 review and C41's separate exception remain historical standing.\",\n    \"C31 topic create/apply/readback/cleanup receipts are historical live evidence for their recorded inputs, not a fresh live run of G9. Historical C30 timing likewise establishes no current performance measurement. L19 retains three charged reads and zero remaining allowance.\",\n    \"No application files were changed, endpoints called, real credentials accessed or OS permissions granted. C26/P08 controller and release gates remain separate. The read-only sandbox prevents writing the designated artifact; this returned JSON is the verdict.\"\n  ],\n  \"inspected_files\": [\n    \"AGENTS.md\",\n    \"GLOSSARY.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-07/request.json\",\n    \"docs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-07/source-inventory.json\",\n    \"docs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-05/verdict-returned.json\",\n    \"docs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-06/verdict-returned.json\",\n    \"docs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-06/acceptance.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/chunks/C31.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/review-protocol.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/decisions.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/dependencies.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/parity-matrix.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/test-catalogue.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/status.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/WORF-START-HERE.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/C30-owner-score-override-2026-11-02.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/C31-conditional-owner-override-2026-11-02.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0001-native-operation-authority.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0002-academy-shared-presentation.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0003-native-harness-and-scoped-identity.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0004-managed-workbench-admission.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/review-verdict.schema.json\",\n    \"docs/architecture/checks.json\",\n    \"docs/architecture/native-checks.json\",\n    \"docs/architecture/inputs.lock.json\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/DESIGN-V2.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/invariants.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/state-ownership.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/reviews-administration.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/administration-inventory.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/boards.md\",\n    \"docs/architecture/ui-v2/provenan