"docs/planning/evidence/P09/native-history/Worf-generation-09-complete-before-C32-scoped-confirmation-20261102\",\n  \"qualification\": \"Current C32 Harness ownership changed production bytes; all20 mapped native drivers and18 checks required. Historical C30 timing unchanged, no current timing claim.\"\n}\nFILE docs/planning/evidence/P09/native/cumulative/C32/native-acceptance.json\n{\n  \"schema\": \"airs-v2/native-acceptance/1\",\n  \"subject\": \"C32\",\n  \"recorded_utc\": \"2026-11-02T18:35:47Z\",\n  \"method\": \"cua\",\n  \"performed_by\": \"Codex gpt-6.1-sol orchestrating the real fixture window through macOS Accessibility (System Events and the ax helper) with fixture WebView self-capture; tools/native-acceptance/acceptance_c32_current.py\",\n  \"host\": \"VirtualMac2,1; macOS 26.6.2 (25G83)\",\n  \"app\": {\n    \"bundle\": \"target/aarch64-apple-darwin/release/bundle/macos/Prisma AIRS Desktop v2 Fixture.app\",\n    \"identifier\": \"io.cdot.prisma-airs-desktop.v2.fixture\",\n    \"executable_sha256\": \"d8bf6a0f91507b6643a9888169873fe5c8bc1c96739bc2cd33b61aa3805ebcca\",\n    \"fixture\": true\n  },\n  \"checks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"C32-N01\",\n      \"description\": \"The Harness renders in the v2 shell on the existing engine: the title row names the tenant, the engine and the workspace; the prerequisites checklist is hidden once satisfied; a fresh tenant shows no seeded conversation, and its first send through the composer starts a user conversation that the real engine answers, titled from that message in the rail (I12).\",\n      \"result\": \"pass\",\n      \"observation\": \"Harness screen True with its status line True; checklist hidden once satisfied True; no seeded conversation True; the first send started a conversation and was answered True (1 model turns), titled from the message in the rail True\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        \"docs/planning/evidence/P09/native/cumulative/C32/native/observations.json\",\n        \"docs/planning/evi