eptance: a production-interface regression pauses this C32 effect before native registration, ends or retires its conversation, then releases it and proves no sheet appears and no command runs; fresh approvals must still support native Cancel and Allow once. This concerns Harness tool decisions, not the closed C31 configuration-review findings.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"evidence_gaps\": [\n    \"E1 \\u2014 crates/desktop-core/tests/ui_v2_harness/main.rs:455 waits until the confirmation is already held before ending the conversation. That test and the retained C32 native Cancel/Allow evidence do not exercise R1's earlier admission-to-registration ordering. Production-interface evidence for that ordering is required with the fix.\"\n  ],\n  \"optional_suggestions\": [],\n  \"recommendation\": \"fail\"\n}\ndocs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-07/post-review-audit.json\n{\n  \"raw_verdict_sha256\": \"ea222ec46d504a4fac8505aa03cf8b1338ec59c0341d714eb6044a4ad937e1dd\",\n  \"compiled_inputs_unchanged\": true,\n  \"scores\": {\n    \"architecture\": 9,\n    \"behavior\": 9,\n    \"authority_security\": 9,\n    \"validation\": 9,\n    \"overall\": 9\n  },\n  \"full_gate_pass\": true\n}\ndocs/planning/reviews/C31/attempt-07/receipt.json\n{\n  \"scores\": {\n    \"architecture\": 9,\n    \"behavior\": 9,\n    \"authority_security\": 9,\n    \"validation\": 9,\n    \"overall\": 9\n  },\n  \"recommendation\": \"pass\",\n  \"required_fixes\": [],\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"evidence_gaps\": [],\n  \"optional_suggestions\": [\n    \"Retained nonrequired presentation note: apps/desktop/src/v2/admin/review-sheet.tsx displays Draft for issued and completed rotations although the rotation panel reports the correct stage. Deriving that pill from RotationView.stage would remove the inconsistency; this does not require another C31 cycle.\"\n  ],\n  \"verdict_sha256\": \"ea222ec46d504a4fac8505aa03cf8b1338ec59c0341d714eb6044a4ad937e1dd\",\n  \"post_review_audit_sha256\": \"ca4bf6c8e5bab